  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>dextromoramide</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N02AC01</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Lançon JP et al. 1989</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>surgical patients</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>dextromoramide</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_dextromoramide/Dextromoramide_Lanon1989_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>Mean elimination half-life</td><td>215.3</td><td>min</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr><tr><td>apparent final volume of distribution</td><td>0.58</td><td>l.kg-1</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>mean systemic clearance</td><td>2.0</td><td>ml.kg-1.min-1</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr></table><h4>About dextromoramide</h4><p>Dextromoramide is a narcotic opioid analgesic, classified among diphenylpropylamine derivatives, that has been used as a painkiller. It is not an approved medicine today; databases list it as experimental and illicit, so it appears to have no current authorised medical use.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q408446\">Wikidata Q408446</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Dextromoramide\">Dextromoramide</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Lançon JP et al. (1989). [Pharmacokinetics of dextromoramide in the surgical patient]. <i>Annales francaises d'anesthesie et de reanimation 8(5):488–492</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0750-7658(89)80015-2\">10.1016/s0750-7658(89)80015-2</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2576345\">2576345</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Lançon_1989: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
